WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:11.020
My landing was embarrassing — bright rocks confused my sensors and I bounced twice before settling down.

2
00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:15.810
I dug the first trenches ever made on another world.

3
00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:23.890
Then I slept… until two astronauts walked over and said hello in November 1969.

4
00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:28.880
Two and a half years later, someone came to visit.
